### ------------------------------
### INSCRIPTIONS (création comptes)
### ------------------------------

### Inscription administrateur
POST http://localhost:5050/api/auth/register?lng=fr
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Admin",
  "lastName": "Principal",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin1234",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Inscription professeur
POST http://localhost:5050/api/auth/register?lng=fr
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "prof@example.com",
  "password": "prof1234",
  "role": "prof"
}

### Inscription élève
POST http://localhost:5050/api/auth/register?lng=fr
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jean",
  "lastName": "Luc",
  "email": "eleve@example.com",
  "password": "eleve1234",
  "role": "eleve"
}

